---
layout: base.njk
lastModified: 2026-09-29
title: Ski Clubs, Shops & Mountain Partners
description: Meet the ski clubs, outdoor shops, and trip organizers connected with SkiBuds across North America. Explore our partners or get in touch about joining.
pageScripts:
  - partner-filter.js
  - partner-outbound.js
---

<section class="band">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Partners</p>
    <h1>Ski clubs, shops,<br>and mountain partners</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Shops, clubs, and trip organizers we work with across North America. Want to be
      listed? <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Get in touch</a>.
    </p>
    <p>Looking for a crew for your next resort day? Explore <a href="/find-ski-buddies/">ski buddy discovery</a>, <a href="/ski-carpool/">carpool planning</a>, and our <a href="/guides/how-to-find-ski-buddies/">guide to finding people to ski with</a>.</p>

    <!-- Category filter -->
    <div class="partner-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter partners by category" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <button type="button" class="btn partner-filter-btn partner-filter-btn--active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--quiet partner-filter-btn" data-filter="shop" aria-pressed="false">Shops</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--quiet partner-filter-btn" data-filter="club" aria-pressed="false">Clubs</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--quiet partner-filter-btn" data-filter="trip-organizer" aria-pressed="false">Trip Organizers</button>
    </div>

    <div class="partners">
      {% for partner in site.partners %}
      <article class="partner" data-category="{{ partner.category }}">
        <a href="{{ partner.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Visit {{ partner.name }} (opens in a new tab)">
          {% image partner.logo, partner.name ~ " logo", "auto", "", "lazy" %}
        </a>
        <h2 class="partner__name">{{ partner.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ partner.description | safe }}</p>
        <span class="partner-category" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--text-muted);">{{ partner.category | capitalize }}</span>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



<!-- Partner outbound tracking: delegated listener, once per link per pageload, no preventDefault -->
